{"slug": "S02E15", "video_name": "Community - S02E15 - Early 21st Century Romanticism Bluray-1080p Proper.mkv", "subtitle_name": "Community - S02E15 - Early 21st Century Romanticism Bluray-1080p Proper.en.srt", "duration_seconds": 1271.941, "language": "en", "stt_provider": "groq", "stt_model": "whisper-large-v3", "segment_count": 474, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 6.372765680851065, "text": "Why does being a librarian"}, {"start": 6.372765680851065, "end": 11.5199995, "text": "make her even hotter?"}, {"start": 11.82, "end": 12.719999, "text": "They're keepers of knowledge."}, {"start": 13.0, "end": 14.34, "text": "She holds the answers to all of our questions,"}, {"start": 14.559999, "end": 17.039999, "text": "like will you marry me and why are there still libraries?"}, {"start": 17.3, "end": 18.08, "text": "I want to be a book."}, {"start": 18.64, "end": 20.539999, "text": "She can pick me up, flip through my pages,"}, {"start": 20.9, "end": 22.38, "text": "make sure nobody drew wieners in me."}, {"start": 23.84, "end": 25.32, "text": "Hey, maybe if we're too loud, she'll shush us."}, {"start": 27.019999, "end": 27.38, "text": "Books!"}, {"start": 27.38, "end": 27.519999, "text": "Books!"}, {"start": 28.439999, "end": 29.14, "text": "Vitale, get her to sleep."}, {"start": 30.0, "end": 36.18, "text": "Jeff, what do you do when you and your best friend"}, {"start": 36.18, "end": 37.92, "text": "want to ask the same girls at the Valentine's dance,"}, {"start": 37.98, "end": 39.04, "text": "but neither of you have dibs"}, {"start": 39.04, "end": 40.64, "text": "because you both fell in love with her at first sight?"}, {"start": 40.76, "end": 43.2, "text": "Well, I don't believe in dibs or love at first sight"}, {"start": 43.2, "end": 45.72, "text": "or love or best friends or doing things,"}, {"start": 45.94, "end": 47.12, "text": "but it's good you brought this to me."}, {"start": 47.18, "end": 48.399998, "text": "You're gonna have to open your heart one day, Jeff."}, {"start": 48.52, "end": 49.1, "text": "What happens if I don't?"}, {"start": 49.14, "end": 50.34, "text": "I miss the heart-opening deadline?"}, {"start": 51.36, "end": 52.42, "text": "Valentine's crappin' time."}, {"start": 53.68, "end": 54.86, "text": "Opening my heart is on my list."}, {"start": 57.059998, "end": 57.42, "text": "Pierce?"}, {"start": 57.739998, "end": 58.16, "text": "Mm-hmm?"}, {"start": 58.28, "end": 58.8, "text": "What was that?"}, {"start": 58.8, "end": 59.8, "text": "Come."}, {"start": 59.8, "end": 60.8, "text": "Why aren't you chewing?"}, {"start": 60.8, "end": 63.8, "text": "Because I'm using my mouth for this dumb conversation."}, {"start": 67.799995, "end": 68.799995, "text": "Bye."}, {"start": 69.799995, "end": 71.237495, "text": "That's my friend Paige."}, {"start": 71.237495, "end": 72.799995, "text": "She's cool, but whatever."}, {"start": 72.799995, "end": 73.799995, "text": "She's cute."}, {"start": 73.799995, "end": 74.362495, "text": "Oh, Troy."}, {"start": 74.362495, "end": 76.987495, "text": "Before you go barking up that tree, I have"}, {"start": 76.987495, "end": 79.799995, "text": "to tell you that she might not be interested."}, {"start": 79.799995, "end": 80.799995, "text": "Why wouldn't she be..."}, {"start": 80.799995, "end": 81.299995, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 81.299995, "end": 82.799995, "text": "Is she..."}, {"start": 82.799995, "end": 85.799995, "text": "a friend of Ellen?"}, {"start": 85.799995, "end": 87.979996, "text": "Yes, Annie, but you can say the word."}, {"start": 88.2, "end": 90.28, "text": "Paige is a lesbian."}, {"start": 96.1334, "end": 99.913396, "text": "Pierce, as someone who's been calling me a lesbian for the last year and a half,"}, {"start": 99.97339, "end": 103.21339, "text": "I'm sure that you don't have anything to say about me being friends with one."}, {"start": 103.8534, "end": 104.8534, "text": "Nothing off the cuff."}, {"start": 105.5934, "end": 107.61339, "text": "What I do have is a prepared statement."}, {"start": 123.54899499999999, "end": 130.415638825438, "text": "And in summation good luck"}, {"start": 130.415638825438, "end": 135.69767253731342, "text": "and bon appetit Many"}, {"start": 135.69767253731342, "end": 141.77201130597015, "text": "many paragraphs of that"}, {"start": 141.77201130597015, "end": 147.52418992335453, "text": "were oddly supportive"}, {"start": 147.52418992335453, "end": 149.989409330805, "text": "Wait till"}, {"start": 149.989409330805, "end": 154.23064702104233, "text": "you hear the one"}, {"start": 154.23064702104233, "end": 157.94173, "text": "I have for you"}, {"start": 164.13973000000001, "end": 166.21973, "text": "Okay, I know that wasn't gum."}, {"start": 166.37974, "end": 166.91973, "text": "You're right."}, {"start": 167.43973, "end": 169.03973, "text": "It was an awesome exit pill."}, {"start": 169.43973, "end": 171.21973, "text": "Zip, zap, zoey."}, {"start": 172.57973, "end": 173.05973, "text": "Bye."}, {"start": 174.67972, "end": 176.93973, "text": "We gotta do something about piercing those painkillers."}, {"start": 185.38572000000002, "end": 186.90573, "text": "He's recovering from broken legs."}, {"start": 186.90573, "end": 187.84073, "text": "He sure is."}, {"start": 187.84073, "end": 189.28573, "text": "You can moonwalk."}, {"start": 189.38572000000002, "end": 191.04572000000002, "text": "I'm sure he's almost through his prescription."}, {"start": 191.34573, "end": 192.59406333333334, "text": "Besides, he's a baby boomer."}, {"start": 192.59406333333334, "end": 193.48573000000002, "text": "They invented drugs."}, {"start": 193.66572000000002, "end": 195.1702017910448, "text": "Yeah, they also invented TV."}, {"start": 195.1702017910448, "end": 197.26573000000002, "text": "Have you seen him control one of those?"}, {"start": 197.44573000000003, "end": 199.10572000000002, "text": "Intervention, intervention, intervention."}, {"start": 199.34573, "end": 199.92573000000002, "text": "Count me out."}, {"start": 200.00573000000003, "end": 201.52574, "text": "If we can't count you out, he listens to you."}, {"start": 201.60572000000002, "end": 203.26573000000002, "text": "Well, he also listens to the bare-naked ladies."}, {"start": 203.46574, "end": 204.94573000000003, "text": "Go get their dumbasses to help you."}, {"start": 205.10572000000002, "end": 205.50573000000003, "text": "Whoa!"}, {"start": 205.98573000000002, "end": 206.50573000000003, "text": "Back it up."}, {"start": 206.56573, "end": 209.68572, "text": "Okay, Jeff, you are clearly in a bad space today,"}, {"start": 209.82572000000002, "end": 213.79814303797468, "text": "but Pierce is our friend and the bare-naked ladies are triple platinum."}, {"start": 213.79814303797468, "end": 214.24574, "text": "Are you?"}, {"start": 214.24574, "end": 217.94573000000003, "text": "Why does everyone leap to defend that band so aggressively?"}, {"start": 218.42573000000002, "end": 219.7174825773196, "text": "And how much stuff do we have to go"}, {"start": 219.7174825773196, "end": 222.00573000000003, "text": "through this year before my friendship stops being questioned?"}, {"start": 222.16572000000002, "end": 225.26573000000002, "text": "Well, maybe friendship is about going through a lot of stuff, Jeff."}, {"start": 225.40573, "end": 228.36573, "text": "And maybe B&L has two Billboard Awards to your zero."}, {"start": 228.50573000000003, "end": 229.21853000000002, "text": "Oh, okay."}, {"start": 229.21853000000002, "end": 230.48573000000002, "text": "They're B&L now."}, {"start": 230.76573000000002, "end": 232.80573, "text": "We need a shorthand for the bare-naked ladies."}, {"start": 232.98573000000002, "end": 234.74574, "text": "That's how fundamental they are."}, {"start": 234.76573000000002, "end": 235.10572000000002, "text": "Fundamental."}, {"start": 235.18574, "end": 237.84573, "text": "You know what Pierce probably needs more than anything?"}, {"start": 238.32572000000002, "end": 239.36573, "text": "Some space."}, {"start": 240.00573000000003, "end": 240.68574, "text": "Maybe I do, too."}, {"start": 240.98573000000002, "end": 241.42573000000002, "text": "You know what?"}, {"start": 241.42573000000002, "end": 244.74083204081634, "text": "Maybe we all need some space to pull the knife out of the back"}, {"start": 244.74083204081634, "end": 249.28573, "text": "of the most celebrated Canadian alt-rock band of the mid-90s, you selfish, jaded ass."}, {"start": 249.38572000000002, "end": 251.16572000000002, "text": "This is a fight."}, {"start": 251.16572000000002, "end": 252.94572000000002, "text": "We are fighting."}, {"start": 255.42573000000002, "end": 255.88572000000002, "text": "Jeff."}, {"start": 256.24574, "end": 256.5422094117647, "text": "Hello."}, {"start": 256.5422094117647, "end": 258.76573, "text": "I hear you're fighting with your study group."}, {"start": 258.84573, "end": 259.18574, "text": "Correct."}, {"start": 259.36573, "end": 261.6250873404255, "text": "Now, you won't know this, being American,"}, {"start": 261.6250873404255, "end": 264.54572, "text": "but tonight, Liverpool are playing Manchester United."}, {"start": 264.80573000000004, "end": 266.58300272727274, "text": "I'm a stylish American, Professor."}, {"start": 266.58300272727274, "end": 269.40573, "text": "I've been forcing myself to be into soccer since 2004."}, {"start": 269.40573, "end": 270.72572731707317, "text": "Ah, then it's destiny."}, {"start": 270.72572731707317, "end": 274.32572000000005, "text": "God gave you a British friend and a massive TV for a reason."}, {"start": 274.42573000000004, "end": 277.05040841121496, "text": "Oh, it's Valentine's Day, and even though we're fighting, I"}, {"start": 277.05040841121496, "end": 279.18574, "text": "did promise the study group I'd go to the dance."}, {"start": 279.20573, "end": 280.618312983871, "text": "You promised the study group?"}, {"start": 280.618312983871, "end": 281.25153983870973, "text": "Whip a crack!"}, {"start": 281.25153983870973, "end": 285.24574000000007, "text": "I'll see you at precisely 6.30, or as the English call it, Gravedigger's Biscuits."}, {"start": 285.54571999999996, "end": 285.80573000000004, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 294.16571999999996, "end": 297.0857, "text": "That moonwalk back there was streets ahead, buddy."}, {"start": 297.54571999999996, "end": 298.34569999999997, "text": "Hey, thanks, buddy."}, {"start": 298.34569999999997, "end": 299.84569999999997, "text": "Hey, Pierce."}, {"start": 299.84569999999997, "end": 301.10572, "text": "Hey, it's you."}, {"start": 301.10572, "end": 305.1413635897436, "text": "Yeah the tiny man you see when you take enough pills We have a"}, {"start": 305.1413635897436, "end": 308.9166430769231, "text": "good time don we Pierce I ain hurting And you want to keep"}, {"start": 308.9166430769231, "end": 313.79847000000007, "text": "this going right Because I sure you noticed the prescription is almost done"}, {"start": 314.09846000000005, "end": 317.77845, "text": "I don't think the doctor, he's a doctor, you know, why don't you want..."}, {"start": 317.77845, "end": 321.41847000000007, "text": "Pierce, if doctors are so smart, why are there millions of them?"}, {"start": 322.99845000000005, "end": 323.99845000000005, "text": "Look in your hand."}, {"start": 327.53846, "end": 329.09846000000005, "text": "It's Valentine's, buddy."}, {"start": 330.33844999999997, "end": 331.19847000000004, "text": "Be mine."}, {"start": 331.31845999999996, "end": 334.45328333333333, "text": "Mariah, my name is Abed"}, {"start": 334.45328333333333, "end": 338.67848000000004, "text": "Nadir, my associate Troy Barnes"}, {"start": 338.67848000000004, "end": 339.53846, "text": "Charmed, I'm sure"}, {"start": 339.53846, "end": 343.03846, "text": "Are you the guys that keep staring at me and intermittently yelling out books?"}, {"start": 343.17848000000004, "end": 343.81845999999996, "text": "The very same"}, {"start": 343.81845999999996, "end": 346.29847000000007, "text": "We're both interested in taking you to the Valentine's dance"}, {"start": 346.29847000000007, "end": 348.09846000000005, "text": "But we are also best friends with each other"}, {"start": 348.09846000000005, "end": 349.65147837209304, "text": "It is of utmost importance we protect that"}, {"start": 349.65147837209304, "end": 351.27845, "text": "friendship from the stresses of courting you"}, {"start": 351.27845, "end": 353.69847000000004, "text": "So we're trying to be as direct and above board about this as possible"}, {"start": 353.69847000000004, "end": 355.39845, "text": "Will you go to the dance with one of us?"}, {"start": 355.43845999999996, "end": 356.63847, "text": "And if so, which one?"}, {"start": 357.81845999999996, "end": 359.23847, "text": "We need to get something straight first"}, {"start": 359.23847, "end": 361.85847, "text": "This is the cutest thing that's ever happened to me"}, {"start": 361.85847, "end": 363.15846, "text": "But"}, {"start": 363.15846, "end": 365.33844999999997, "text": "I don't know either one of you"}, {"start": 365.33844999999997, "end": 366.35847, "text": "Give us a moment"}, {"start": 366.35847, "end": 369.85847, "text": "I need to eat those tacos"}, {"start": 369.85847, "end": 372.07844, "text": "New proposal"}, {"start": 372.07844, "end": 373.19847000000004, "text": "Get to know us at the dance"}, {"start": 373.19847000000004, "end": 374.87846, "text": "And decide there which of us you'd like to see again"}, {"start": 374.87846, "end": 377.03846, "text": "Okay, deal"}, {"start": 377.03846, "end": 377.81845999999996, "text": "Nice"}, {"start": 377.81845999999996, "end": 380.03846, "text": "What's in the briefcase?"}, {"start": 381.03846, "end": 382.15846, "text": "Oh, tacos"}, {"start": 382.15846, "end": 384.09846000000005, "text": "You want one?"}, {"start": 384.93845999999996, "end": 385.15846, "text": "No"}, {"start": 385.15846, "end": 387.43845999999996, "text": "Great, we really wanted them"}, {"start": 387.43845999999996, "end": 388.19847000000004, "text": "Yeah, we're gonna eat them"}, {"start": 388.19847000000004, "end": 392.29847000000007, "text": "So, like, would you change clothes in front of her?"}, {"start": 392.95844, "end": 396.39845, "text": "Annie, I know your lack of world experience creates curiosity,"}, {"start": 396.63847, "end": 399.35847, "text": "but questions like that can make you seem a little bit homophobic."}, {"start": 399.55845, "end": 401.07844, "text": "It's homophobic to ask questions?"}, {"start": 401.17848000000004, "end": 403.73847, "text": "If you have to ask if it's homophobic to ask questions,"}, {"start": 403.87846, "end": 405.51844000000006, "text": "haven't you already answered your own question?"}, {"start": 406.75846, "end": 407.33844999999997, "text": "Have I?"}, {"start": 407.47846000000004, "end": 408.27697851851855, "text": "Don't know."}, {"start": 408.27697851851855, "end": 409.43845999999996, "text": "Not a homophobe."}, {"start": 411.33844999999997, "end": 413.23847, "text": "Oh, there's Paige."}, {"start": 413.55845, "end": 416.37846, "text": "Should I ask her 500 questions about being a lesbian,"}, {"start": 416.37846, "end": 418.73847, "text": "or should I just treat her like a normal person?"}, {"start": 419.05845, "end": 421.01844000000006, "text": "That's a question you can ask."}, {"start": 427.19847000000004, "end": 427.67848000000004, "text": "Hey."}, {"start": 428.19847000000004, "end": 428.63847, "text": "Hi."}, {"start": 430.63844000000006, "end": 431.61848, "text": "I'm not a lesbian."}, {"start": 432.15846, "end": 432.35847, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 433.23847, "end": 434.09846000000005, "text": "I'm not either."}, {"start": 434.33844999999997, "end": 434.51844000000006, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 435.17848000000004, "end": 436.89845, "text": "But it's cool that you're friends with one."}, {"start": 437.53846, "end": 437.87846, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 438.73847, "end": 439.83844999999997, "text": "Paige isn't a lesbian."}, {"start": 440.19843000000003, "end": 441.55845, "text": "She just likes hanging out with Britta"}, {"start": 441.55845, "end": 443.67848000000004, "text": "because it makes her feel cool to have a lesbian friend."}, {"start": 444.11848, "end": 450.33186, "text": "But Britta not a lesbian and she thinks that Paige is Guess what Annie Paige"}, {"start": 450.33186, "end": 455.8912, "text": "and I are going to the dance together Hope I stay straight all right"}, {"start": 460.65219999999994, "end": 461.19974426229504, "text": "Oh, sorry."}, {"start": 461.19974426229504, "end": 463.99222, "text": "My friend's a tad homophobic, so I was doing a bit."}, {"start": 467.59219999999993, "end": 468.11222, "text": "Bye."}, {"start": 470.2322, "end": 470.75219999999996, "text": "Ooh."}, {"start": 471.95219999999995, "end": 473.5322, "text": "Pretty exciting first half."}, {"start": 473.8522, "end": 475.93219999999997, "text": "Yeah, zero-zero electrifying."}, {"start": 475.93219999999997, "end": 479.37219999999996, "text": "Aw, worried that your six-headed ball and chain will be calling."}, {"start": 479.9722, "end": 480.33221999999995, "text": "Fine."}, {"start": 484.3522, "end": 486.39219999999995, "text": "That's better, you big slut."}, {"start": 490.25219999999996, "end": 491.13219999999995, "text": "It's Chang."}, {"start": 495.23019999999997, "end": 495.8902, "text": "Chang?"}, {"start": 495.8902, "end": 496.3302, "text": "Why?"}, {"start": 496.4502, "end": 497.0702, "text": "I don't know."}, {"start": 497.25019999999995, "end": 498.5702, "text": "I can hear you guys."}, {"start": 499.25019999999995, "end": 501.6302, "text": "What are you doing here, Chang, and how do you know where I live?"}, {"start": 501.7702, "end": 504.8502, "text": "I can answer both of those questions by returning your driver's license."}, {"start": 509.5302, "end": 509.79072631578947, "text": "Ha!"}, {"start": 509.79072631578947, "end": 510.8328315789474, "text": "There it is."}, {"start": 510.8328315789474, "end": 512.8302, "text": "Man U versus Liverpool."}, {"start": 513.3702, "end": 514.8060974358974, "text": "For God's sake, just let him in."}, {"start": 514.8060974358974, "end": 516.8702, "text": "He's wearing the right colours and everything."}, {"start": 517.5101999999999, "end": 518.1702, "text": "Come in."}, {"start": 518.4302, "end": 519.5501999999999, "text": "Mind if I chank?"}, {"start": 519.9102, "end": 522.2102199999999, "text": "Hey, man, check this out."}, {"start": 522.2102199999999, "end": 522.9902, "text": "You're dead!"}, {"start": 530.6902, "end": 537.5101999999999, "text": "Well, anyway, the thing I was going to show you guys is pretty cool."}, {"start": 537.6702, "end": 539.2302, "text": "I'm ignoring you and watching soccer."}, {"start": 539.5301999999999, "end": 540.6692909090908, "text": "Just sit down, Chang."}, {"start": 540.6692909090908, "end": 543.1102, "text": "There's space for three fannies on this sofa."}, {"start": 543.4302, "end": 545.6501999999999, "text": "Hey, in England, fanny means vagina, right?"}, {"start": 545.7701999999999, "end": 547.6501999999999, "text": "In England, everything means vagina."}, {"start": 549.9702, "end": 551.2102, "text": "I'm going to make it up to you, winger."}, {"start": 551.5502, "end": 554.29023, "text": "Even though, like I said, we're a place to put a lamp."}, {"start": 554.9302, "end": 556.6501999999999, "text": "But let me order a pizza."}, {"start": 556.8901999999999, "end": 557.9457932203389, "text": "Ooh, I love pizza."}, {"start": 557.9457932203389, "end": 560.3502, "text": "In England, we call them Italian fannies."}, {"start": 560.5301999999999, "end": 561.2701999999999, "text": "I'm hooking us up."}, {"start": 562.1702399999999, "end": 562.5702, "text": "Sully."}, {"start": 562.7502, "end": 563.7701999999999, "text": "Go use the landline."}, {"start": 564.1702399999999, "end": 564.5702, "text": "Landline?"}, {"start": 565.3702, "end": 566.5101999999999, "text": "Okay, Grandma Belle."}, {"start": 566.5101999999999, "end": 570.5702, "text": "Starburns"}, {"start": 570.5702, "end": 571.5902, "text": "it's Chang"}, {"start": 571.5902, "end": 572.5502, "text": "remember that"}, {"start": 572.5502, "end": 573.1302, "text": "Pizziomi"}, {"start": 573.1302, "end": 574.5702, "text": "well"}, {"start": 574.5702, "end": 575.6501999999999, "text": "it's time to pay up"}, {"start": 575.6501999999999, "end": 577.3702, "text": "party at"}, {"start": 577.3702, "end": 577.7701999999999, "text": "Wingers"}, {"start": 577.7701999999999, "end": 578.4502, "text": "tonight"}, {"start": 578.4502, "end": 580.7502, "text": "yeah you can"}, {"start": 580.7502, "end": 581.6302, "text": "tell people"}, {"start": 581.6302, "end": 587.7502, "text": "so Mariah"}, {"start": 587.7502, "end": 588.5301999999999, "text": "what you get with me"}, {"start": 588.5301999999999, "end": 589.8102, "text": "is the complete package"}, {"start": 589.8102, "end": 590.3102, "text": "HBO"}, {"start": 590.3102, "end": 590.8702, "text": "Showtime"}, {"start": 590.8702, "end": 591.2701999999999, "text": "Stars"}, {"start": 591.2701999999999, "end": 592.0301999999999, "text": "Stars Black"}, {"start": 592.0301999999999, "end": 593.0301999999999, "text": "sounds expensive"}, {"start": 593.0301999999999, "end": 594.1102, "text": "with all due respect"}, {"start": 594.1102, "end": 594.6702399999999, "text": "to my friend here"}, {"start": 594.6702399999999, "end": 595.4902, "text": "if you go with me"}, {"start": 595.4902, "end": 596.9902, "text": "You can expect this on a dashboard."}, {"start": 600.0, "end": 604.2386663, "text": "I feel like"}, {"start": 604.2386663, "end": 608.3060733555556, "text": "everyone's"}, {"start": 608.3060733555556, "end": 611.559999, "text": "staring."}, {"start": 612.0, "end": 612.799999, "text": "Not that I care."}, {"start": 613.0, "end": 614.78, "text": "Well, of course they're staring."}, {"start": 615.04, "end": 618.74, "text": "They've probably never seen a straight girl and a lesbian so comfortable together."}, {"start": 619.22, "end": 619.74, "text": "Exactly."}, {"start": 621.539999, "end": 623.019999, "text": "Those two were talking about us."}, {"start": 623.68, "end": 625.76, "text": "Well, let's give them something to really talk about."}, {"start": 627.26, "end": 628.099998, "text": "Let's do it."}, {"start": 630.0, "end": 633.44, "text": "He's a..."}, {"start": 633.44, "end": 634.34, "text": "Hi, sorry."}, {"start": 641.52, "end": 645.739998, "text": "Cool music, huh?"}, {"start": 650.48, "end": 652.26, "text": "Oh, nice call, ref."}, {"start": 652.56, "end": 653.54, "text": "Bite my banger!"}, {"start": 653.88, "end": 656.62, "text": "Jeff, something's up with your toothbrush, man."}, {"start": 656.62, "end": 657.68, "text": "What the hell?"}, {"start": 657.86, "end": 658.78, "text": "I had to get cleaned up."}, {"start": 659.0, "end": 659.48, "text": "Why?"}, {"start": 660.0, "end": 662.0, "text": "Oh yeah!"}, {"start": 662.0, "end": 664.0, "text": "Pizza time!"}, {"start": 664.0, "end": 666.0, "text": "Leonard?"}, {"start": 666.0, "end": 668.0, "text": "Where are the white women at?"}, {"start": 668.0, "end": 669.3650793650794, "text": "No, there are no white women here, Leonard."}, {"start": 669.3650793650794, "end": 670.0, "text": "This is not a party!"}, {"start": 670.0, "end": 672.0, "text": "Don't tell that to Magnitude."}, {"start": 672.0, "end": 674.0, "text": "Who's Magnitude?"}, {"start": 674.0, "end": 676.0, "text": "Yo, yo, yo, yo, yo!"}, {"start": 676.0, "end": 678.0, "text": "Pop, pop!"}, {"start": 678.0, "end": 682.3421212121212, "text": "Bam Bam Come on Andy That is"}, {"start": 682.3421212121212, "end": 688.235, "text": "my analysis of the Saw movie franchise"}, {"start": 689.494995, "end": 690.350997, "text": "That about does it, Saw."}, {"start": 690.350997, "end": 691.635, "text": "I think it's time for you to choose."}, {"start": 696.115, "end": 697.755, "text": "Abed, could you get us some punch?"}, {"start": 698.095, "end": 698.354996, "text": "On it."}, {"start": 700.915, "end": 702.494995, "text": "You guys are really cute together."}, {"start": 703.595, "end": 704.1949999999999, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 704.1949999999999, "end": 708.395, "text": "But, you know, having to actually choose, I..."}, {"start": 708.395, "end": 710.515, "text": "Hey, we both agreed to this."}, {"start": 710.595, "end": 712.515, "text": "We're both very comfortable with each other, so I won't be..."}, {"start": 712.515, "end": 713.535, "text": "No, I choose you, Troy."}, {"start": 716.075, "end": 716.475, "text": "Punch."}, {"start": 718.05499, "end": 718.895, "text": "Hey, Abed."}, {"start": 718.994995, "end": 719.155, "text": "Hey."}, {"start": 719.895, "end": 721.015, "text": "I, um..."}, {"start": 721.015, "end": 722.05499, "text": "She, uh..."}, {"start": 722.05499, "end": 722.615, "text": "Just..."}, {"start": 722.615, "end": 723.175, "text": "She chose me."}, {"start": 725.015, "end": 725.41499, "text": "Cool."}, {"start": 726.1949999999999, "end": 726.815, "text": "You can have this, then."}, {"start": 727.375, "end": 728.135, "text": "Thank you, Mariah."}, {"start": 728.295, "end": 728.815, "text": "Have a great night."}, {"start": 736.975, "end": 737.975, "text": "Great."}, {"start": 738.39499, "end": 739.39499, "text": "Pierce?"}, {"start": 739.39499, "end": 741.39499, "text": "You go straight to hell!"}, {"start": 744.39499, "end": 745.9505455555555, "text": "Oh, I'm sorry."}, {"start": 745.9505455555555, "end": 746.39499, "text": "I..."}, {"start": 746.39499, "end": 749.39499, "text": "I don't know, I've been going through all these mood swings lately."}, {"start": 749.39499, "end": 752.39499, "text": "You understand we care about you, right?"}, {"start": 754.39499, "end": 755.39499, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 757.39499, "end": 759.39499, "text": "Well, look, here's the deal."}, {"start": 759.39499, "end": 762.39499, "text": "I am not sharing you with them."}, {"start": 762.39499, "end": 768.1175857831325, "text": "So before this goes further you have a choice"}, {"start": 768.1175857831325, "end": 772.95, "text": "to make my friend Look at the lesbians"}, {"start": 776.83, "end": 777.31, "text": "Lesbians!"}, {"start": 777.61, "end": 778.69, "text": "Screw you!"}, {"start": 782.17, "end": 782.8699979411764, "text": "No, no."}, {"start": 782.8699979411764, "end": 785.56999, "text": "I don't care what they say."}, {"start": 785.65, "end": 786.6172727272727, "text": "Well, I don't either."}, {"start": 786.6172727272727, "end": 788.69, "text": "I just wish it wasn't such an issue for them."}, {"start": 788.85, "end": 790.19, "text": "Yeah, but that starts with us."}, {"start": 790.19, "end": 793.83, "text": "It starts with S."}, {"start": 807.61, "end": 809.13, "text": "I've never done this before."}, {"start": 809.23, "end": 809.83, "text": "Me neither."}, {"start": 810.61, "end": 811.51, "text": "Wait, what?"}, {"start": 814.51, "end": 818.41, "text": "So, curious about one thing."}, {"start": 818.41, "end": 820.47, "text": "What was wrong with Abed?"}, {"start": 821.19, "end": 824.31, "text": "Well, I mean, he did talk about the Saw movies for two hours."}, {"start": 824.59, "end": 827.81, "text": "Yeah, but there are eight of them, and they're two hours apiece."}, {"start": 828.09, "end": 830.79, "text": "And the first one did redefine the genre, and..."}, {"start": 830.79, "end": 832.45, "text": "I would love to be his friend."}, {"start": 832.67, "end": 833.2778787878788, "text": "I know you would."}, {"start": 833.2778787878788, "end": 833.85, "text": "It's incredible."}, {"start": 834.04999, "end": 835.41, "text": "But romantically, he's..."}, {"start": 837.51, "end": 838.41, "text": "He's..."}, {"start": 838.41, "end": 843.10999, "text": "I hate her, I hate her, I hate her, I hate her, I hate her!"}, {"start": 845.03, "end": 845.65, "text": "What happened?"}, {"start": 846.17, "end": 851.4741577333333, "text": "She called you weird I am weird Not as weird as her Who the hell is"}, {"start": 851.4741577333333, "end": 858.04498, "text": "Nicholas Nickleby You wouldn shut up about it I know There someone out there for us"}, {"start": 860.04498, "end": 861.04498, "text": "Happy Valentine's Day."}, {"start": 862.04498, "end": 863.04498, "text": "It is now."}, {"start": 872.04498, "end": 873.04498, "text": "Ignore her."}, {"start": 877.04498, "end": 880.54498, "text": "It's weird, but I've never heard of Magnitude before tonight."}, {"start": 880.885, "end": 882.065, "text": "He's a one-man party."}, {"start": 882.9449999999999, "end": 884.605, "text": "You're always busy with your study group."}, {"start": 884.925, "end": 886.345, "text": "Well, he's not with them tonight."}, {"start": 886.985, "end": 888.085, "text": "Oh, yeah!"}, {"start": 888.865, "end": 890.405, "text": "You were drinking, Duncan."}, {"start": 890.765, "end": 892.085, "text": "Full sub on that one."}, {"start": 892.185, "end": 893.525, "text": "Oh, yeah!"}, {"start": 894.065, "end": 895.04498, "text": "Pop, pop!"}, {"start": 895.3050000000001, "end": 896.265, "text": "Pop, pop!"}, {"start": 896.485, "end": 897.2850000000001, "text": "Pop, pop!"}, {"start": 897.505, "end": 898.345, "text": "Pop, pop!"}, {"start": 898.54498, "end": 899.065, "text": "Pop, pop!"}, {"start": 899.4449999999999, "end": 900.3050000000001, "text": "Pop, pop!"}, {"start": 900.3050000000001, "end": 900.885, "text": "Pop, pop!"}, {"start": 900.885, "end": 902.925, "text": "Come on."}, {"start": 904.2850000000001, "end": 905.925, "text": "I never said I was a lesbian."}, {"start": 905.925, "end": 907.7850000000001, "text": "and why didn't you just ask me?"}, {"start": 907.9449999999999, "end": 909.7649799999999, "text": "What am I, a homophobe?"}, {"start": 909.825, "end": 911.54498, "text": "I don't care about people's preferences."}, {"start": 911.7850000000001, "end": 912.845, "text": "You so care."}, {"start": 912.9449999999999, "end": 914.7049999999999, "text": "You were clearly just hanging out with me"}, {"start": 914.7049999999999, "end": 915.9649999999999, "text": "because you thought I was gay."}, {"start": 916.16498, "end": 916.565, "text": "So?"}, {"start": 916.745, "end": 918.04498, "text": "What were you doing with me?"}, {"start": 918.9649999999999, "end": 920.085, "text": "Hey, what does it matter?"}, {"start": 920.2850000000001, "end": 921.7850000000001, "text": "You know, we're both just humans"}, {"start": 921.7850000000001, "end": 923.625, "text": "trying to make our way through this crazy world."}, {"start": 924.345, "end": 925.425, "text": "You're the worst."}, {"start": 925.66498, "end": 925.9449999999999, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 926.225, "end": 928.7850000000001, "text": "And for the record, I never thought you were cool."}, {"start": 928.7850000000001, "end": 930.525, "text": "I only thought you were a lesbian."}, {"start": 935.925, "end": 936.012, "text": "you"}, {"start": 936.012, "end": 940.3119996999999, "text": "Paige is straight."}, {"start": 941.8919996, "end": 942.3719997, "text": "Really?"}, {"start": 944.232, "end": 949.5319995, "text": "Well, when she was gay, I thought it was really cool of you to make out with her."}, {"start": 950.712, "end": 951.592, "text": "Thanks, Annie."}, {"start": 953.9319999999999, "end": 955.232, "text": "Come on, kiss her!"}, {"start": 957.472, "end": 957.9519989999999, "text": "Annie."}, {"start": 957.9519989999999, "end": 958.0519989999999, "text": "Annie."}, {"start": 958.0519989999999, "end": 963.2586663999999, "text": "Oh, thanks,"}, {"start": 963.2586663999999, "end": 965.1519999999999, "text": "man."}, {"start": 965.211999, "end": 966.351998, "text": "Just leave those."}, {"start": 966.4519989999999, "end": 967.131999, "text": "I'll get them in the morning."}, {"start": 967.4519989999999, "end": 968.0519969999999, "text": "Oh, it's okay."}, {"start": 970.492, "end": 971.5519969999999, "text": "Are you wearing my underwear?"}, {"start": 972.332, "end": 973.632, "text": "Oh, I just need an apparel."}, {"start": 973.731997, "end": 974.391997, "text": "I did some laundry here."}, {"start": 975.012, "end": 976.231997, "text": "I don't have a washing machine."}, {"start": 978.751998, "end": 979.852, "text": "What the hell?"}, {"start": 980.512, "end": 981.512, "text": "Okay, don't get mad."}, {"start": 981.612, "end": 982.0519969999999, "text": "Don't get mad."}, {"start": 984.132, "end": 985.132, "text": "I'm homeless, Jeff."}, {"start": 985.711997, "end": 985.972, "text": "Okay?"}, {"start": 985.972, "end": 988.832, "text": "When my wife found out about Shirley and me, she kicked me out."}, {"start": 989.012, "end": 989.9319999999999, "text": "For good this time."}, {"start": 990.2719999999999, "end": 992.992, "text": "My whole life is in this dishwasher, man."}, {"start": 993.7919999999999, "end": 995.612, "text": "Well, some of it's also soaking in your bathtub."}, {"start": 998.2919999999999, "end": 1000.012, "text": "Oh, so Lacey's is sleeping."}, {"start": 1000.631995, "end": 1001.1919961290322, "text": "You know what?"}, {"start": 1001.1919961290322, "end": 1003.112, "text": "I should probably just crash here and, you know,"}, {"start": 1003.192, "end": 1004.991996, "text": "I can start looking for a place in the morning."}, {"start": 1007.092, "end": 1007.372, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 1008.1719959999999, "end": 1012.8531336333333, "text": "You orchestrated this entire party just so you could weasel your way into staying here I"}, {"start": 1012.8531336333333, "end": 1017.1619080458333, "text": "not even going to notice Hey Jeff don kill the messenger but you have four hermit"}, {"start": 1017.1619080458333, "end": 1020.938735, "text": "crabs in your bathroom sink You fall in love with them I named one Jeff"}, {"start": 1021.01874, "end": 1022.7387299999999, "text": "How long did you actually think you were going to stay here?"}, {"start": 1022.798736, "end": 1023.5787339999999, "text": "Just a month."}, {"start": 1024.21873, "end": 1025.258735, "text": "Three tops."}, {"start": 1025.99873, "end": 1027.69874, "text": "I mean, how long's our lease?"}, {"start": 1031.69874, "end": 1038.438735, "text": "Way to go, idiots!"}, {"start": 1039.438735, "end": 1043.618735, "text": "We rockin' this so big up, look at that"}, {"start": 1043.618735, "end": 1045.3138563414634, "text": "All right, everybody out."}, {"start": 1045.3138563414634, "end": 1046.3987339999999, "text": "I'm not kidding."}, {"start": 1047.05874, "end": 1051.73873, "text": "It's been very interesting getting to know you all much, much better."}, {"start": 1052.59873, "end": 1058.4520633333332, "text": "Starburns, Leonard, Magnitude, Pop-Pop, Swizzle, Scandalous,"}, {"start": 1058.4520633333332, "end": 1061.37873, "text": "C-Dub, Tim, Mighty D, Glisten."}, {"start": 1061.758735, "end": 1062.6702248085105, "text": "Good night, everyone."}, {"start": 1062.6702248085105, "end": 1063.3646932340425, "text": "Faster, move it."}, {"start": 1063.3646932340425, "end": 1063.798736, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 1063.798736, "end": 1068.1387399999999, "text": "Well, I hope you found tonight therapeutic"}, {"start": 1068.1387399999999, "end": 1070.87873, "text": "Because I would love to pretend that that was my plan"}, {"start": 1070.87873, "end": 1074.99872, "text": "I actually started to have fun until that maniac tried to move in"}, {"start": 1074.99872, "end": 1078.35874, "text": "What is it about me that makes broken people flock to me?"}, {"start": 1078.99872, "end": 1079.6787299999999, "text": "Is it my height?"}, {"start": 1080.29874, "end": 1082.77874, "text": "Do huddled masses mistake me for the Statue of Liberty?"}, {"start": 1082.97874, "end": 1083.55874, "text": "I don't know"}, {"start": 1083.55874, "end": 1087.4387299999999, "text": "But being as how you are halfway through your second year at Greendale"}, {"start": 1087.4387299999999, "end": 1092.9259893650792, "text": "You may want to either stop resisting Or admit that you actually starting"}, {"start": 1092.9259893650792, "end": 1097.4360655555554, "text": "to enjoy it Well you assume I enjoy it because you think you"}, {"start": 1097.4360655555554, "end": 1101.64547, "text": "enjoy it It true I am very lonely You want a nice little"}, {"start": 1104.4454700000001, "end": 1108.1900352173914, "text": "taste of what you're missing in a relationship with six nutcases?"}, {"start": 1108.1900352173914, "end": 1108.4780786956521, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 1108.4780786956521, "end": 1109.74547, "text": "Let's turn on my phone"}, {"start": 1109.74547, "end": 1113.057476, "text": "and listen to the 39 messages they left tonight."}, {"start": 1113.057476, "end": 1115.26548, "text": "Hello, you have no new messages."}, {"start": 1115.26548, "end": 1116.4962492307693, "text": "Huh."}, {"start": 1116.4962492307693, "end": 1119.26548, "text": "That's..."}, {"start": 1119.26548, "end": 1121.26548, "text": "Huh."}, {"start": 1121.26548, "end": 1123.26546, "text": "Since you've got it turned on,"}, {"start": 1123.26546, "end": 1125.26546, "text": "why don't you call me a cab and then pay for it?"}, {"start": 1125.26546, "end": 1127.26546, "text": "Must be in some kind of trouble."}, {"start": 1127.26546, "end": 1127.6525567741937, "text": "Ah."}, {"start": 1127.6525567741937, "end": 1131.26546, "text": "What a relief that would be."}, {"start": 1133.26546, "end": 1135.26546, "text": "Tell you what, if you need me,"}, {"start": 1135.26546, "end": 1137.26546, "text": "I'm gonna be waiting for my cab down here."}, {"start": 1137.26546, "end": 1140.26546, "text": "Have a special nap."}, {"start": 1145.26546, "end": 1151.5933220253166, "text": "Thanks bro I be"}, {"start": 1151.5933220253166, "end": 1154.7103799859356, "text": "gone in"}, {"start": 1154.7103799859356, "end": 1159.6086139240508, "text": "the morning"}, {"start": 1159.6086139240508, "end": 1165.4153579002236, "text": "Yeah whatever"}, {"start": 1165.4153579002236, "end": 1167.2020483544306, "text": "Okay"}, {"start": 1167.2020483544306, "end": 1172.2643379746837, "text": "maybe I stay"}, {"start": 1172.2643379746837, "end": 1178.5922, "text": "a while Thirsty"}, {"start": 1179.1922000000002, "end": 1180.13219, "text": "Don't push it."}, {"start": 1180.6722000000002, "end": 1185.9921900000002, "text": "It might not shock you guys to hear the real reason we had a fight today."}, {"start": 1187.5322, "end": 1189.7728922093024, "text": "It wasn't about the bare-naked ladies, although"}, {"start": 1189.7728922093024, "end": 1191.63219, "text": "I do have some unresolved issues there."}, {"start": 1192.91219, "end": 1194.7121900000002, "text": "Caring about a person can be scary."}, {"start": 1195.3322, "end": 1199.0722, "text": "Caring about six people can be a horrifying, embarrassing nightmare."}, {"start": 1199.0922, "end": 1200.0321800000002, "text": "At least for me."}, {"start": 1200.8322, "end": 1203.7722, "text": "But if I can't say it today, when can I say it?"}, {"start": 1204.7522000000001, "end": 1205.8922000000002, "text": "I love you guys."}, {"start": 1207.2322000000001, "end": 1209.5522, "text": "Oh, and Pierce, take it from an expert."}, {"start": 1210.2322000000001, "end": 1212.2722, "text": "These knuckleheads are right outside your heart."}, {"start": 1213.2922, "end": 1213.87218, "text": "Let them in."}, {"start": 1214.87218, "end": 1215.9722000000002, "text": "Before it's too late."}, {"start": 1218.0922, "end": 1219.2922, "text": "Happy Valentine's Day."}, {"start": 1227.5222, "end": 1228.2222000000002, "text": "Be mine?"}, {"start": 1228.6222, "end": 1229.5422, "text": "Right, yes."}, {"start": 1234.6102, "end": 1234.9902, "text": "Love you."}, {"start": 1235.1702, "end": 1235.6502, "text": "Amazing."}, {"start": 1237.5302, "end": 1241.9502, "text": "You're cute."}, {"start": 1243.2102, "end": 1243.87018, "text": "No, wait."}, {"start": 1246.37018, "end": 1247.0302, "text": "Kiss me."}, {"start": 1247.2302, "end": 1250.3501999999999, "text": "There has got to be a way to make money off of this."}, {"start": 1251.2702, "end": 1252.0302, "text": "I've been cheating."}, {"start": 1259.3822, "end": 1259.7822, "text": "No."}, {"start": 1260.5421999999999, "end": 1261.4822, "text": "It says email me."}]}